.TH libssh2_session_banner_get 3 "2026-11-14" libssh2
.SH NAME
libssh2_session_banner_get \- get the remote banner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <libssh2.h>

const char *libssh2_session_banner_get(oLIBSSH2_SESSION *session);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Once the session has been setup and \fI\fIlibssh2_session_handshake(3)\fP\fP has
completed successfully, this function can be used to get the server id from
the banner each server presents.
.SH RETURN VALUE
A pointer to a string or NULL if something failed. The data pointed to is
allocated and associated to the session handle and is freed by libssh2
when \fI\fIlibssh2_session_free(3)\fP\fP is used.
.SH AVAILABILITY
Added in 1.4.0
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libssh2_session_banner_set(3),
.BR libssh2_session_free(3),
.BR libssh2_session_handshake(3)
